# Environment variables — explicit safety net. Real secrets live in Vercel
# project env vars, never in repo. The `.env` line catches any accidental
# `.env` file (without .local suffix) created by future developers.
# AUDIT 2026-08-13 (F-11): one rule, no future gap — bare .env.<name>
# files (.env.production, .env.staging) were NOT covered before.
.env*
!.env.example

*.BACKUP_*
backups/

